{"words": [{"text": "۞ وَمِنْ", "translation": "And from"}, {"text": "أَهْلِ", "translation": "(the) People"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ", "translation": "(of) the Book"}, {"text": "مَنْ", "translation": "(is he) who"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "تَأْمَنْهُ", "translation": "you entrust him"}, {"text": "بِقِنطَارٍۢ", "translation": "with a great amount of wealth"}, {"text": "يُؤَدِّهِۦٓ", "translation": "he will return it"}, {"text": "إِلَيْكَ", "translation": "to you"}, {"text": "وَمِنْهُم", "translation": "And from them"}, {"text": "مَّنْ", "translation": "(is he) who"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "تَأْمَنْهُ", "translation": "you entrust him"}, {"text": "بِدِينَارٍۢ", "translation": "with a single coin"}, {"text": "لَّا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "يُؤَدِّهِۦٓ", "translation": "he will return it"}, {"text": "إِلَيْكَ", "translation": "to you"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "دُمْتَ", "translation": "you keep constantly"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِ", "translation": "over him"}, {"text": "قَآئِمًۭا ۗ", "translation": "standing"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "That"}, {"text": "بِأَنَّهُمْ", "translation": "(is) because they"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "said"}, {"text": "لَيْسَ", "translation": "Not"}, {"text": "عَلَيْنَا", "translation": "on us"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "concerning"}, {"text": "ٱلْأُمِّيِّـۧنَ", "translation": "the unlettered people"}, {"text": "سَبِيلٌۭ", "translation": "any [way] (accountability)"}, {"text": "وَيَقُولُونَ", "translation": "And they say"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "about"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلْكَذِبَ", "translation": "the lie"}, {"text": "وَهُمْ", "translation": "while they"}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "know"}], "sahih": "And among the People of the Scripture is he who, if you entrust him with a great amount [of wealth], he will return it to you. And among them is he who, if you entrust him with a [single] coin, he will not return it to you unless you are constantly standing over him [demanding it]. That is because they say, \"There is no blame upon us concerning the unlearned.\"1 And they speak untruth about Allāh while they know [it]."}